itor is a few orders of magnitude more complicated to design/implement in a way that would seem to me to be satisfactory. For various reasons above I can't see myself keeping up an effort towards that.\r\n\r\n(In case it wasn't clear: the review comments are good and I have no problem with those. It's about the point add/remove features, integrating it properly (not simply a port IMO), and the fact that I don't plan to use this point editor feature in my main project.)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2568144513/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":1,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3936439941","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100725#issuecomment-3936439941","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100725","id":3936439941,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7qoU6F","user":{"login":"fire","id":32321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32321?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire","html_url":"https://github.com/fire","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-20T18:27:45Z","updated_at":"2026-02-20T18:2